\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">X.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">An.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">6.6.17</span> </span>: c. <span class=\"lex-gram\">inf.</span>, <span class=\"gk\">ὁ. Νικίαν ἑορακέναι</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">allows, confesses that</b> he has seen.., <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Eup.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">181.3</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ὁ. σε ἀδικεῖν</span> I <b class=\"lex-tr\">confess</b> that I am wronging thee, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">E.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Fr.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">265</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ὁ. κλέπτειν</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Ar.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Eq.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">296</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Antipho</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2.4.8</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ὁ. καπηλεύειν</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Isoc.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2.1</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ὁ. οὐκ εἰδέναι</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">confess</b> ignorance, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Arist.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">SE</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">183b8</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ὁ. πατάξαι</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Ar.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">V.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1422</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ὁμολογοῦσι νοσεῖν μᾶλλον ἢ σωφρονεῖν</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Phdr.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">231d</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ὁ. ἓν πάντα εἶναι</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Heraclit.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">50</spa